		@GrokSet: Multi-Party Human-LLM Interactions in Social Media







Matteo Migliarini* · Berat Ercevik* · Oluwagbemike Olowe · Saira Fatima · Sarah Zhao · Minh Anh Le · Vasu Sharma · Ashwinee Panda
*Equal contribution







		The Dataset


@GrokSet is the first large-scale dataset of multi-party human–LLM interactions collected from public social media. Unlike existing corpora (e.g., WildChat, LMSYS-Chat-1M) that capture private, dyadic (one-on-one) user-assistant… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/taaaaanish/GrokSet.
